* Circle\nSponsorPaymaster
** Role in ERC-4337
*** EntryPoint v0.7\n(PackedUserOperation)
*** Pays the prefund from\nits EntryPoint deposit
*** Validation phase only
*** Off-chain policy,\non-chain verification
** BasePaymaster\n(plumbing)
*** immutable ENTRY_POINT
*** _requireFromEntryPoint()
*** deposit / withdrawTo
*** addStake / unlockStake\n/ withdrawStake
*** UUPS + Ownable + Pausable
*** uint256[50] __gap
** SponsorPaymaster\n(policy)
*** EnumerableSet of\nverifying signers
*** parsePaymasterAndData()
*** getHash()
*** _validatePaymasterUserOp()
*** add / remove / getAllSigners
** paymasterAndData layout
*** [0:20] paymaster address
*** [20:36] verification gas limit
*** [36:52] postOp gas limit
*** [52:116] validUntil, validAfter
*** [116:] ECDSA signature
** Signed payload
*** packUpToPaymasterAndData()
*** both paymaster gas limits
*** block.chainid
*** address(this)
*** validUntil, validAfter
*** excludes userOp.signature
** Validation outcome
*** tryRecover, never reverts
*** _packValidationData(\nsigFailed, until, after)
*** EntryPoint maps to\nAA34 / AA32
*** empty context\nso postOp is skipped
** Operations
*** CREATE2 deterministic\naddress across chains
*** Stake required to read\nown storage (ERC-7562)
*** Owner can pause,\nupgrade, withdraw
*** Signer rotation emits\nno event
